uc2 \f2 Turkey Tries Erdogan Rival Gulen In Absentia\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 A U.S.-based Muslim cleric, who has become Turkish President \f28 \uc2 \f2 Recep Tayyip Erdogan\f28 \uc2 \f2 's chief foe, is being tried in absentia, accused of attempting to overthrow the government by masterminding corruption probes in 2013 that targeted people close to the Turkish leader.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Germany Gets Subdued Demand at Schatz Auction\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Germany's first government bond auction this year was narrowly covered as yields remained close to record low levels, pressured by stubbornly low inflation in Germany and the eurozone.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Write to tanya.ashreena@wsj.com\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 January 06, 2016 06:51 ET (11:51 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020160106ec160016s\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
