\par\par \b \uc2 China's  \highlight22\uc2 Central Bank \highlight\uc2  Steps In to Prop Up Yuan\b0\par\par\uc2 260 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 2016\par 08:25\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2016, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 SHANGHAI\u8212\'20\'14\b \highlight22\uc2 China\b0 \highlight\uc2 's \b \highlight22\uc2 central bank\b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 intervened\b0 \highlight\uc2  in the \b \highlight22\uc2 foreign-exchange\b0 \highlight\uc2  market Tuesday to prop up a weakening yuan, two people familiar with the matter said, as Beijing adopted a broad suite of measures to stem a selloff in the country's stock market.\par \par \uc2 The move came after the \uc2 People's Bank of China\uc2  said it would pump 130 billion yuan ($19.9 billion) into the financial system\u8212\'20\'14the biggest single-day injection since Sept. 8\u8212\'20\'14as tumbling stocks and a sliding \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  threatened to further erode confidence in the world's No. 2 economy.\par \par \uc2 The \uc2 PBOC\uc2  used some of the nation's biggest state-run banks as agent entities to buy the yuan and sell U.S. dollars, helping the Chinese \b \highlight22\uc2 currency\b0 \highlight\uc2  reverse its deep losses from Monday, the people, who declined to be named, told The Wall Street Journal.\par \par \uc2 One dollar was trading at 6.5199 yuan, down from 6.5338 yuan at Monday's close.\par \par \uc2 The Shanghai Composite Index slid 0.3% at 3287.71, after a 6.9% slump Monday due to concerns about a weakening manufacturing sector and a falling yuan.\par \par \uc2 In a rare move, the country's securities regulator released statements before the stock market opened Tuesday, seeking to alleviate concerns about an expected increase in the supply of shares as well as newly launched index trading limits known as circuit breakers.\par \par \uc2 Write to Shen Hong at hong.shen@wsj.com\par \par \uc2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\par \par \uc2 January 05, 2016 02:25 ET (07:25 GMT)\par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020160105ec15000ht\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
