\par\par \b \uc2 London Shares Boosted by China Move; Miners Gain\b0\par\par\uc2 1,545 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 5 Januar 2016\par 09:45\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2016, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par Market News: \par  \par FTSE 100          6148.84 +55.41 +0.91% \par FTSE 250         17205.93 +83.78 +0.49% \par FTSE AIM All-Share 736.40  +0.69 +0.09% \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 London Stocks Up; China Helps Miners\f28 \par \par \uc2 0820 GMT The U.K.'s FTSE 100 traded higher, helped by a stabilisation in the Chinese stock markets overnight following the Chinese government's \b \highlight22\uc2 intervention\b0 \highlight\uc2 . \uc2 Tesco\uc2  led the way, gaining 4.4% after a \uc2 Deutsche Bank\uc2  ratings raise, China's activity saw miners buoy the market. \uc2 Glencore\uc2  gained 2.3%, \uc2 Anglo American\uc2  was up 2.3%, and \uc2 BHP Billiton\uc2  rose by 2.2%. Travel companies also performed strongly: \uc2 TUI\uc2  rose by 1.7%, \uc2 InterContinental Hotels\uc2  was up 1.4%, and \uc2 British Airways\uc2 -parent IAG gained 1.3%. A warm winter and sluggish Christmas figures saw Next drop 3.4%. \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Top Stories: \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 UK Clothing Retailer Next Hit by Warm Weather\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.K. clothing retailer \f28 \uc2 \f2 Next PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (NXT.LN) Tuesday said full-price sales growth for this financial year is below previous guidance after warm weather resulted in a disappointing performance over Christmas.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 PBOC\f28 \uc2 \f2  Injects $20 Billion to Calm Nervous Investors\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  injected 130 billion yuan ($19.9 billion) in short-term funds into the country's financial system, according to a statement, in an effort to help calm jittery investors after Monday's sharp stock selloff.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 China's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  Steps In to Prop Up Yuan\f28 \par \par \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  in the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 foreign-exchange\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market Tuesday to prop up a weakening yuan, as Beijing adopted a broad suite of measures to stem a selloff in the country's stock market. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Companies News: \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mosman Oil and Gas Issues Review Notice to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Origin Energy\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mosman Oil and Gas Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . (MSMN.LN), a New Zealand and Australian focused oil exploration and development company, said Tuesday it has issue a review notice to \f28 \uc2 \f2 Origin Energy Ltd\f28 \uc2 \f2 . (ORG.AU) under the deal to buy the South Taranaki Energy project in New Zealand.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Scancell Shares Rise on Publication of Moditope Paper in \f28 \uc2 \f2 Cancer Research\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Shares in \f28 \uc2 \f2 Scancell Holdings PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (SCLP.LN) rose on Tuesday after the immunotherapies developer announced the publication of a paper in a well-known cancer journal describing the science behind the company's Moditope platform and the experimental results that support it.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Renewables Infrastructure Invests in Portfolio of French Solar Projects\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Renewables Infrastructure Group\f28 \uc2 \f2  (TRIG.LN) said Tuesday it has exchanged contracts to invest 57 million euros ($62.54 million) in a portfolio of 15 French solar ground-mounted and rooftop PV projects, alongside \f28 \uc2 \f2 Akuo Energy\f28 \uc2 \f2 .\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Carr's FY on Track Despite Slow Start in Engineering\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Carr's Group PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (CARR.LN), an the agriculture, food and engineering group, on Tuesday said it continues to trade in line with expectations for the year ending Sept. 3, despite a slower than expected start to the period at its engineering business.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 bwin.party digital entertainment\f28 \uc2 \f2  4Q Net Revenue +5%\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Online gaming business \f28 \uc2 \f2 bwin.party digital entertainment\f28 \uc2 \f2  (BPTY.LN) said Tuesday net revenue in the fourth quarter grew 5% compared with the same period in 2014, driven by sports betting and casino that enjoyed strong performances, particularly through mobile channels.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Sigma Capital Sees 2015 Profit Ahead of Views\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Sigma Capital Group PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (SGM.LN), a private rented sector and regeneration specialist, on Tuesday said it expects a pretax profit for 2015 in excess of 2 million pounds ($3 million), which is significantly ahead of current market expectations.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Eagle Eye Solutions Appoints Tim Mason As Chairman\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Digital marketing technology company \f28 \uc2 \f2 Eagle Eye Solutions Group PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (EYE.LN) Tuesday announced the appointment of Tim Mason, former chairman of the retailer Bonmarche Holdings PLC (BON.LN), as its new chairman.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 AA Launches Connected-Car JV\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Breakdown and auto recovery firm \f28 \uc2 \f2 AA PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (AA.LN) said Tuesday it has launched Intelematics Europe, a joint venture to develop connected-car software for services and products to be provided by roadside assistance clubs for their consumer and business markets.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 UK Clothing Retailer Next Hit by Warm Weather\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 U.K. clothing retailer \f28 \uc2 \f2 Next PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (NXT.LN) Tuesday said full-price sales growth for this financial year is below previous guidance after warm weather resulted in a disappointing performance over Christmas.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Great Portland Estates\f28 \uc2 \f2  Sells 60 Great Portland Street for GBP102M\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Great Portland Estates PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (GPOR.LN) said Tuesday it has exchanged contracts to sell 60 Great Portland Street for 102.15 million pounds ($152.29 million), in line with the September 2015 valuation.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Bango Expands Collaboration with \f28 \uc2 \f2 Microsoft\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Mobile payments company \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bango PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (BGO.LN) Tuesday said it has expanded its agreement and integration with \f28 \uc2 \f2 Microsoft Corp\f28 \uc2 \f2  (MSFT), meaning charging payments to the user's phone bills will become available to Windows Store customers.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Motive Television\f28 \uc2 \f2  Signs Pact with Holder of Loan Notes\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Motive Television PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (MTV.LN) announced on Tuesday that it has reached agreement with the largest convertible loan notes, or CLN, holder to acquire its 1.4 million pounds ($2.1 million) of CLN's for GBP100,000 in cash plus a 5-year warrant to acquire 5% of the company.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Wizz Air\f28 \uc2 \f2  December Traffic Up 22%\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Wizz Air Holdings PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2 's (WIZZ.LN) December passenger numbers were up by 22% from the previous year as it continues expanding routes around Central and Eastern Europe.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Fenner Chief Executive Takes Temporary Leave Due to Ill Health\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Industrial belt maker \f28 \uc2 \f2 Fenner PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (FENR.LN) Tuesday said its chief executive \f28 \uc2 \f2 Nick Hobson\f28 \uc2 \f2  has taken temporary leave due to ill health, with non-executive chairman \f28 \uc2 \f2 Mark Abrahams\f28 \uc2 \f2  stepping in as interim executive chairman.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Cairn Homes\f28 \uc2 \f2  To Acquire Dublin's Hanover Quay\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Irish homebuilder \f28 \uc2 \f2 Cairn Homes PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (CRN.LN) said Tuesday it has agreed to acquire a site in the South Dublin docklands Strategic Development Zone that will allow it to develop a portfolio of apartments.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 M Winkworth CEO Buys 4,500 Shares/138P\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Estate agent \f28 \uc2 \f2 M Winkworth PLC\f28 \uc2 \f2  (WINK.LN) Tuesday said its chief executive \f28 \uc2 \f2 Dominic Agace\f28 \uc2 \f2  bought 4,500 shares in Winkworth at 138 pence (205.8 cents) each and now has 550,628 shares, or 4.3% of the company. \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Market Talk: \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Credit Suisse Upgrades Travis Perkins\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0835 GMT \f28 \uc2 \f2 Credit Suisse\f28 \uc2 \f2  describes \f28 \uc2 \f2 Travis Perkins\f28 \uc2 \f2  as its preferred play within the U.K. housing/construction sector, lifting its investment recommendation stance to outperform from neutral and raising its target price to 2255p from 1838p. The bank forecasts average 2016-17 sales and EPS growth of 7% and 14%, respectively, saying \f28 \uc2 \f2 Travis Perkins\f28 \uc2 \f2  is its preferred way to play the \f28 \uc2 \f2 U.K. government\f28 \uc2 \f2 's desire to materially increase housebuilding. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Travis Perkins\f28 \uc2 \f2  is a "compelling and resilient investment case," says \f28 \uc2 \f2 Credit Suisse\f28 \uc2 \f2 . Shares climb 1.3% to 1962p.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Scancell Shares Rise on Publication of Moditope Paper\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0823 GMT Scancell shares are up after the immunotherapies developer announced the publication of a paper in a well-known cancer journal describing the science behind the company's Moditope platform and the experimental results that support it. "We believe this should further widen the recognition of Scancell's Moditope platform," said Panmure Gordon analyst Mike Mitchell. The brokerage retains a buy recommendation. Shares climb 6.3% to 21.1p.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Cantor Fitzgerald Upgrades Royal Mail to Buy\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0814 GMT The U.K. delivery market is changing fast as more people shop online, with more operators in the sector including a giant like \f28 \uc2 \f2 Amazon.com\f28 \uc2 \f2  and smaller players such as U.K. Mail Group. But with an established network across the country, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Royal Mail\f28 \uc2 \f2  is well placed to cope with competition and benefit from growing parcel volumes even as letters decline, say analysts at \f28 \uc2 \f2 Cantor Fitzgerald\f28 \uc2 \f2 , noting that the former nationalized postal service is maintaining market share. As a result it upgrades its stance on \f28 \uc2 \f2 Royal Mail\f28 \uc2 \f2  to buy from hold and lifts its target price to 530p from 500p. Shares up 2.6% at 449p.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 RBS\f28 \uc2 \f2  Should Make Strong Progress in 2016, Says RBC\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0809 GMT Now that it is no longer hampered by litigation and restructuring charges, \f28 \uc2 \f2 Royal Bank of Scotland\f28 \uc2 \f2  should make strong progress in 2016, \f28 \uc2 \f2 RBC Capital Markets\f28 \uc2 \f2  says. With \f28 \uc2 \f2 RBS\f28 \uc2 \f2  ending 2015 by passing the U.K. banking stress test, the completion of its sale of the U.S. Citizens Financial Group, and this year likely to see a dividend, RBC says, these positives have yet to be fully factored into the current share price. RBC raises its recommendation for \f28 \uc2 \f2 RBS\f28 \uc2 \f2  to outperform from sector perform with an increased target price of 375p from 350p. \f28 \uc2 \f2 RBS\f28 \uc2 \f2  shares rise 1.2% to 296.9p.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Next Sales Guidance Could Impact Sector\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0806 GMT Next falls 3.3% to 6950p after stating that sales growth for this financial year will be below previous guidance, citing warm weather over Christmas. \f28 \uc2 \f2 Shore Capital\f28 \uc2 \f2  notes in particular that sales and profit fell below management expectations for the 2016 financial year. "We believe the market will take today's statement as possibly an early indicator that trading for apparel retailers was challenging in the final quarter of 2015," says Shore. Adds this could possibly have a negative impact across the sector during today's trading on the stock market.\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 Contact: London NewsPlus, Dow Jones Newswires; +44-20-7842-9319\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 January 05, 2016 03:45 ET (08:45 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020160105ec15000qi\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw205\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal3075\pichgoal600
