\par\par \b \uc2 Taiwan Shares End Down in Heavy Trade -- Market Talk\b0\par\par\uc2 1,685 \uc2 W\u246\'00\'F6rter\par \uc2 30 November 2015\par 08:28\par \uc2 Dow Jones Institutional News\par \uc2 DJDN\par \uc2 Englisch\par \uc2 Copyright \u169\'00\'A9 2015, Dow Jones & Company, Inc.   \par \par \uc2 0728 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ] Taiwan's Taiex recoups some losses after hitting a two-week low, ending 0.9% lower Monday at 8320.61 with turnover of NT$132.32 billion. The heavy turnover is fuelled by \uc2 MSCI\uc2 's index rebalancing, which lowers the weighting of Taiwan shares to 11.91% from 12.34% among emerging markets. Most tech and financial heavyweights plunged, but TSMC (2330.TW) and \uc2 Largan Precision\uc2  (3008.TW) stay relatively stable. \uc2 OBI Pharma\uc2  (4174.OT), which is part of the \uc2 MSCI\uc2  index for the first time, sets all-time high of NT$676 in a six-day record streak. \uc2 TaiMed Biologics\uc2  (4147.OT), another recent hot spot, soars to record NT$219 on its 6th day of listing. Biotech stocks start to look a bid overheated, says Golden Gate Securities, but sector rotation will likely continue in the near term. With corporate results due, the broker expects investors to focus on the solar sector. (john.wu@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: TAG \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 0727 GMT [\uc2 Dow Jones\uc2 ] A output cut from \uc2 Organization of the Petroleum Exporting Countries\uc2  is necessary to prevent crude prices from crashing lower, says Oil Market Journal, a trade publication widely read in energy circles, noting that U.S. commercial crude stock piles are still over 100 million barrels above the level same period last year. "In fact, demand is at its weakest for a year, contracting by 1.8% on a four-week average basis and the U.S. dollar remains in an uptrend with the \uc2 Federal Reserve\uc2  set to hike interest rates in December," says the journal. \uc2 Opec\uc2  is scheduled to meet on Friday in Vienna in which issues such as production quotas and prices are expected to be discussed. \uc2 Nymex\uc2  prices are up 6 cents at $41.77/barrel, Brent prices are down 12 cents at $44.74/barrel. (jenny.hsu@wsj.com) \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0727 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] China's government hopes planned reforms of the nation's power grid will ultimately help cut prices for end-users such as factories that are struggling with rising wages and other costs. In a reform blueprint released Monday, the \f28 \uc2 \f2 National Development and Reform Commission\f28 \uc2 \f2 , China's top economic planning body, says it is pushing forward with plans to open China's power markets to private players and expanding pilot schemes aimed at streamlining power-transmission costs, among other measures. In a question-and-answer statement explaining the complex reform plan, the government said lowering electricity expenditures through greater competition were among its key rationales. (brian.spegele@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KLH \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0719 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] Singapore-listed Cache Logistics Trust (K2LU.SG) has entered into an agreement to buy a distribution warehouse facility in Queensland Australia, its sixth warehouse purchase in Australia and a sign of the company's plan to bulk up its presence in the country. The company says that the acquisition of the single-storey industrial warehouse facility provides an attractive net property income yield of 7.1%, and the purchase will be partly funded by proceeds from the recently completed private placement with onshore Australian dollar borrowings. The move is significant given that the property is close to Brisbane's central business district and that the property will be fully leased to Western Star Trucks Australia until 2023, an indication of continued rental income. Units are trading flat at S$0.920. (venkat.pr@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: ALP \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0714 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] The expected imminent interest rate hike in the U.S. may not portend the same in Hong Kong, says Jefferies. The Hong Kong dollar's peg to the U.S. dollar means there is a strict convertibility between the two \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , but not necessarily that their respective rates will move in tandem. Hong Kong's rates are more likely to be impacted by the city's monetary base, which remains "flush," it says. The real effective exchange rate, or the value of the Hong Kong dollar in comparison to other major \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 , also would more readily impact Hong Kong's rates. "The main risk is from any nervousness over China's financial conditions and their need to weaken the RMB," says Jefferies. When Beijing depreciated the yuan this summer, money flooded to Hong Kong banks. (anjie.zheng@wsj.com; Twitter: @anjiezheng) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: DWT \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0716 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] The inclusion of the yuan in the \f28 \uc2 \f2 International Monetary Fund\f28 \uc2 \f2 's basket of \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currencies\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  backing special drawing rights, likely formalized today, won't help the yuan internationalize. What's more important is the reform of China's onshore \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  market, Macaque says in a note. The yuan's weighting in the \f28 \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2  basket could yield just $42 billion in demand for the yuan as a reserve \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  over two years, a relatively small amount, Macaque said. "The key [to yuan internationalization] lies in whether China could develop and open its onshore financial market," Macaque said. The yuan is likely to depreciate gradually after the \f28 \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2  review, due to the broad strength of the dollar. (chuin-wei.yap@wsj.com; Twitter @YapCW) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor JSM \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0716 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] The \f28 \uc2 \f2 Bank of Japan\f28 \uc2 \f2  is likely to sit tight and watch how companies' plans for capital spending materialize over the coming months, while keeping an eye on the results of spring wage negotiations, before considering any further action, says Takahiro Sekido, Japan strategist at Bank of Tokyo-Mitsubishi UFJ. If companies decide to raise wages at a pace well below last year's level, political pressure may heighten on the BOJ to ease further ahead of a summer upper house election, he says. On Monday, BOJ Gov. Haruhiko Kuroda said wage growth will remain slow if the \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  doesn't try to meet its price goal soon, countering a view that he may avoid escalating his reflation policy until salary gains accelerate.(megumi.fujikawa@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: PJK \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0707 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] \f28 \uc2 \f2 Rajesh Exports\f28 \uc2 \f2  (531500.BY) rises 4.3% to 708.70 rupees after it gets jewelry export order worth 11.22 billion rupees ($168 million). The export order is for supply of gold and diamond studded jewelry and medallions from U.A.E. and the order is to be completed by March 2016, the company says in a stock exchange filing. The company, which has the capacity to manufacture 400 tons of gold products annually, will execute the latest order at its manufacturing facility in the southern city of Bangalore. The demand for Indian jewelry has been growing rapidly in overseas markets, the jewelry maker says. (debiprasad.nayak@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: ALP \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0658 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] New Zealand's national purchasing power likely fell for the first quarter since the end of last year in the July-September period, a survey of economists polled by The Wall Street Journal shows. The terms of trade for goods likely decreased by 2.4% in the third quarter, according to median forecasts of the polled economists. They see a 3.0% rise in export prices being outstripped by a 5.4% climb in import prices. The terms of trade rose 1.3% in the second quarter. Official figures are scheduled for release Tuesday (2145 GMT Monday). (paul.jackson@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KLH \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0618 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] The new restructuring package offered to state electricity distribution companies is a positive as it successfully addresses their weak financial positions, which is key to improving the health of India's power sector, says \f28 \uc2 \f2 Fitch Ratings\f28 \uc2 \f2 . The debt-restructuring plan will substantially reduce distribution companies' near-term debt burden and, more importantly, their high interest costs, it adds. Raising power tariffs continue to be a challenge for state governments. So reducing technical and commercial losses over the next two to three years and bringing down generation costs through improved availability of low-cost fuel are vital for long-term success of the program, Fitch says.(debiprasad.nayak@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KLH \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0613 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] Blink and you may have missed it. The offshore yuan was trading at a more than two-month low against the U.S. dollar early Monday before it abruptly spiked. USD/CNH was at 6.4613, then collapsed to 6.4290 implying a stronger yuan, before bouncing back to 6.4460 and then dropping back to 6.4230. A \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  trader based in Hong Kong, where the offshore yuan market is based, said the market suspects \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 China\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 's \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 central bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 intervened\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  to strengthen the yuan. The boost comes just before the \f28 \uc2 \f2 International Monetary Fund\f28 \uc2 \f2  is expected to announce the outcome of its five-year review of the composition of its Special Drawing Rights \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  basket. The \f28 \uc2 \f2 IMF\f28 \uc2 \f2 , which meets at its headquarters in Washington later today, has hinted that the yuan will be included in the SDR, conferring it the status of global reserve \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2 . USD/CNH is now 6.4302 from its Friday close of 6.4506. (ewen.chew@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KLH \par  \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 0601 GMT [\f28 \uc2 \f2 Dow Jones\f28 \uc2 \f2 ] After touching a two-year low of 66.89 on Friday, the India rupee still lingers near that level at its current 66.80 to the U.S. dollar. The buoyancy of the benchmark \f28 \uc2 \f2 ICE\f28 \uc2 \f2  dollar index, which closed above the psychological threshold of 100.00 on Friday due to persistent euro weakness, is keeping most USD/Asia \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 currency\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  pairs up Monday. Though the greenback has generally subsided from its sure-footed Asia opening, there is still potential for the dollar to keep climbing in the near term. The USD/INR daily chart remains bullish if the Bollinger uptrend channel is kept intact by a Monday closing above 66.50. Fundamentally, the prospect of an expansion of quantitative easing by the \f28 \uc2 \f2 European \f28 \b \highlight22\uc2 \f2 Central Bank\f28 \b0 \highlight\uc2 \f2  this week, and the strong likelihood of U.S. interest rates being raised next month, ought to keep the U.S. dollar aloft. USD/INR is now 66.80 from its Friday close of 66.77. (ewen.chew@wsj.com) \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 \par  \par Editor: KLH \f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 (END) Dow Jones Newswires\f28 \par \par \uc2 \f2 November 30, 2015 02:28 ET (07:28 GMT)\f28 \par \par \uc2 Dokument DJDN000020151130ebbu000l0\par }\page {\par\fs20{\*\shppict{\pict\pngblip\picw172\pich40\picscaley100\picscalex100\picwgoal2580\pichgoal600
